Usage: relocation_packer [-u] [-v] [-p] file

Pack or unpack relative relocations in a shared library.

  -u, --unpack   unpack previously packed relative relocations
  -v, --verbose  trace object file modifications (for debugging)
  -p, --pad      do not shrink relocations, but pad (for debugging)

Debug sections are not handled, so packing should not be used on
shared libraries compiled for debugging or otherwise unstripped.
